 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">캠퍼스 창업문화 조성</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">과 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">창업 생태계</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 자리 매김</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -31.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -31.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">□&nbsp;내&nbsp; 용</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -31.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 31.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY헤드라인M'; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">-&nbsp;일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> : 2013. 10. 10(목) 13:30 ~</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">-&nbsp;장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> : 경일대학교 대강당</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">-&nbsp;대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> : 대구·경북지역 대학생</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -28.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">-&nbsp;주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 최</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-F